        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b5a385fd-95dc-5c9e-b851-f91aca7ad82e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: La jolie fille de Perth, Mitridate, re di Ponto, La dame blanche, Lucia di Lammermoor, I puritani, Cavalleria Rusticana, Le chalet, Le domino noir, La fille du régiment, Lakmé, Manon, Mignon, Les noces de Jeannette, Le pré aux clercs, Tosca, La bohème, Werther, Carmen\n- People: Georges Bizet, Jules-Henri Vernoy de Saint-Georges, Jules Adenis, Sir Walter Scott, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Organizations: Opéra-Comique\n- Concepts: opera, opera seria, libretto, musical influence, repertory\n\nFacts:\n- La jolie fille de Perth is an opera in four acts by Georges Bizet.\n- La jolie fille de Perth has a libretto by Jules-Henri Vernoy de Saint-Georges and Jules Adenis.\n- La jolie fille de Perth is based on a novel by Sir Walter Scott.\n- Mitridate, re di Ponto, K. 87 (74a), is an early opera seria in three acts by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.\n- The musical style of La dame blanche heavily influenced Lucia di Lammermoor, I puritani, and La jolie fille de Perth.\n- Opéra-Comique has performed Cavalleria Rusticana, Le chalet, La dame blanche, Le domino noir, La fille du régiment, Lakmé, Manon, Mignon, Les noces de Jeannette, Le pré aux clercs, Tosca, La bohème, Werther, and Carmen more than 1,000 times each.\n- Opéra-Comique has performed Carmen more than 2,500 times.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b19793b0-4fa3-5568-9b4a-f87e6a33da8f",
